          "text": "UNCLASSIFIED U.S. Department of State Case No. M-2017-11727 Doc No. C06550126 Date: 06/12/2018\n\n                                      M-2017-11727    B-00001343365      \"UNCLASSIFIED\"       7/13/2026\n\n\n\n       PTQ3505\n                                                          RELEASE IN PART\n                                                                        25X6,25X9 (NATO)\n\n\n                   CONFIDENTIAL  PTQ3505\n\n      PAGE 01   STATE 236235 181755Z\n       ORIGIN SS-00\n\n       INFO LOG-00 CCO-00 OASY-00 ADS-00 SSO-00   /000R\n\n      DRAFTED BY S/S-O:MARK BYSFIELD\n      APPROVED BY S/S-O:SUSAN ALEXANDER   REVIEW AUTHORITY:  Paul Hilburn, Senior Reviewer\n                          077D92 181756Z/45\n     O 181535Z DEC 97 ZFF5\n      FM SECSTATE WASHDC\n       INFO USDEL SECRETARY IMMEDIATE\n\n     CONFIDENTIALSTATE 236235 TOSEC 300235\n\n\n      THE FOLLOWING USNATO 04267, DATED 18 DEC 97, SENT ACTION SECSTATE\n      WASHDC, IS BEING REPEATED FOR YOUR INFORMATION.\n      QUOTE:\n\n     CONFIDENTIALUSNATO 004267\n\n      OPS CENTER ONLY -- PLEASE PASS EYES ONLY FOR S/S WOLFF\n\n      SECTO\n\n        E.O. 12958: DECL: 12/18/07\n       TAGS: OVIP (MADELEINE K.), NATO\n       SUBJECT: DRAFT REPORTING CABLE ON DECEMBER 17 EAPC\n       MINISTERIAL IN BRUSSELS, BELGIUM\n\n\n          1. CLASSIFIED BY POLAD WILLIAM HARRIS. REASONS: 1.5(B)\n      AND (D).\n                 CONFIDENTIAL\n\n\n\n\n\n                   CONFIDENTIAL\n\n      PAGE 02    STATE 236235 181755Z\n\n          2. BELOW IS THE PROPOSED TEXT OF A REPORTING CABLE ON\n      THE DECEMBER 17 EAPC MINISTERIAL IN BRUSSELS, IN WHICH\n      SECRETARY ALBRIGHT PARTICIPATED. PLEASE PASS APPROVAL\n      FOR TRANSMISSION AND/OR CHANGES TO USNATO AS SOON AS\n\n\n\n\nUNCLASSIFIED U.S. Department of State Case No. M-2017-11727 Doc No. C06550126 Date: 06/12/2018"
