          "text": "UNCLASSIFIED U.S. Department of State Case No. M-2017-11772 Doc No. C06550739 Date: 05/18/2018\n\n                                      M-2017-11772    B-00001351035      \"UNCLASSIFIED\"       7/10/2026\n\n\n\n\n                  SECRET    PTO2432\n\n      PAGE 01   STATE  115889 221240Z                            RELEASE IN FULL\n       ORIGIN NODS-00\n\n       INFO LOG-00 CCO-00 CCOE-00 SAS-00   /000R\n\n      DRAFTED BY: NEA:JOAN POLASHIK\n      APPROVED BY: SIS-O: GRETA HOLTZ\n      DESIRED DISTRIBUTION:\n      NODIS NOT\n                         D81F61 221241Z /38\n     O 221228Z JUN 99 ZFF4\n      FM SECSTATE WASHDC\n      TO AMEMBASSY ABU DHABI NIACT IMMEDIATE\n\n     SECRETSTATE 115889\n\n      NODIS\n\n      FOR NEA A/S MARTIN INDYK\n\n       NIACT DUE TO NEED TO GET TO A/S INDYK BEFORE COB LOCAL TIME\n\n      FOLLOWING STATE 115889 DATED 21 JUNE 99, SENT ACTION\n      MOSCOW, INFO ALL EUROPEAN UNION POST COLLECTIVE,\n       JOINT STAFF, NSC WASHDC, USNATO, SECDEF, BEING\n      REPEATED FOR YOUR ACTION.\n      QUOTE:\n\n     SECRETSTATE 115889\n\n      NODIS\n                 SECRET\n\n      PAGE 02    STATE  115889 221240Z\n\n        E.O. 12958: DECL: 06/14/09\n       TAGS: OVIP (ALBRIGHT, MADELINE K.), PREL,NATO, UNSC, SR,\n     RU\n       SUBJECT: SECRETARY'S MEETING WITH RUSSIAN FOREIGN MINISTER\n       IVANOV, COLOGNE, GERMANY'\n\n          1. (U) CLASSIFIED BY S/S DEPUTY EXECUTIVE SECRETARY STEVE\n      MULL FOR REASON: 1.5(D).\n\n          2. (U) DATES AND LOCATIONS: JUNE 9, 1999, 0730-0900,\n      RENAISSANCE HOTEL, COLOGNE, GERMANY.\n\n          3. (U) PARTICIPANTS:\n         U.S.:\n      THE SECRETARY\n      AMBASSADOR STEPHEN SESTANOVICH, S/NIS\n      AMBASSADOR JAMES DOBBINS, SENIOR ADVISOR ON KOSOVO AND\n      BOSNIA IMPLEMENTATION\n\n\n\n                                                            REVIEW AUTHORITY:  Paul Hare,\n                                                                                   Saninr Raviawar\nUNCLASSIFIED U.S. Department of State Case No. M-2017-11772 Doc No. C06550739 Date: 05/18/2018"
